Title: Last Train / 末班车
Credit: An original MoonFountain demonstration
Author: MoonFountain contributors

# Act One
= A lost signal, two people, one decision.

INT. SIGNAL ROOM - NIGHT #1#

A lamp blinks over a **silent** console. [[PRIVATE_DEMO_NOTE]]

ADA
The platform is empty.
(listens)
No. Someone is still there.

@林
我去看看。

ADA
Take the lamp.

@林 ^
Keep the signal green.

/* PRIVATE_DEMO_CUT: An abandoned alternate ending. */

EXT. PLATFORM - DAWN #2#

The lamp makes a small circle in the fog.

@林
The last train can wait.

> FADE OUT.
